# Waverlite — Nigeria NGN (planned)

Docs: [Waverlite Live Postman](https://documenter.getpostman.com/view/3785878/2s847EQYsS#intro)  
Base URL: `https://api.live.waverlite.com`  
`Content-Type: application/json`  
